	(text "\"RDY\" -1, -2, and -3 are \"ready\" signals for each PCB in the backplane.\nBy default, if no boards are present or if a board has a fault, the LED\nassociated should turn off, as RDY is an active-low signal.\n\nBoards in the backplane must ground their respective RDY signal to \nproperly show as ready."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 202.184 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
